  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Sometimes you just have to get back to basics.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Kineticist 1st or character level 5th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the basic utility wild talent for any one element. If you later gain a level in the kineticist class, you can immediately exchange this basic utility wild talent for a level 1 utility wild talent for which you qualify unless you possess a wild talent the requires the basic utility you wish to replace.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
